名曰穨當。韓太子亦生子，命曰嬰。至孝文十四年，穨當及嬰率其眾降漢。漢封穨當為弓高侯，嬰為襄城侯。吳楚軍時，弓高侯功冠諸將。傳子至孫，孫無子，失侯。嬰孫以不敬失侯。穨當孽孫韓嫣，貴幸，名富顯於當世。其弟說，再封，數稱將軍，卒為案道侯。子代，歲餘坐法死。後歲餘，說孫曾拜為龍頟侯，續說後。","source_term":"生子，因名曰穨當"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji093-003","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"xnj_cjk_pcj_*A"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p005179"]},{"id":"xnj_cjk_pcj_*AB*A","label":"韓嫣（韓信盧綰列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"韓嫣","mention_ids":["c-shiji-093-hanlu:m007-0106"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:m007-0106","chapter_id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:p007","quote":"韓嫣"}],"family_path":{"connection":"grandfather","generation_distance":2,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu","source_id":"s-shiji-093-hanlu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu:p007","quote":"信之入匈奴，與太子俱；及至穨當城，生子，因名曰穨當。韓太子亦生子，命曰嬰。至孝文十四年，穨當及嬰率其眾降漢。漢封穨當為弓高侯，嬰為襄城侯。吳楚軍時，弓高侯功冠諸將。傳子至孫，孫無子，失侯。嬰孫以不敬失侯。穨當孽孫韓嫣，貴幸，名富顯於當世。其弟說，再封，數稱將軍，卒為案道侯。子代，歲餘坐法死。後歲餘，說孫曾拜為龍頟侯，續說後。","source_term":"穨當孽孫韓嫣"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji093-005","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","ancestor_person_id":"xnj_cjk_pcj_*AB","parent_person_id":null,"intermediate_person_ids":[null]},"id_aliases":["cbr-p005181"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-093-hanlu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-093","chapter_id":"c-shiji-093-hanlu","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-093-hanlu:m007-0106"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-093-hanlu:p007"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-093-hanlu"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_rela